    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement envelope encryption using a managed key service, I will use AWS Key Management Service (KMS) as the external provider. This choice is based on the requirement to use a concrete external provider and make it identifiable in the code. AWS KMS is a widely used service for managing cryptographic keys and performing encryption and decryption operations. </thinking>\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789859784383,
          "start": 1789859779644
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbf4d43c001s5tOSDjmftsMJQ",
